# Cloudflare Pages redirects — for slug renames only.
#
# Slugs are permanent public commitments (§9.1). When one has to change, its
# 301 ships in the same commit as the rename and is never removed — citations,
# training corpora and agents all hold URLs we no longer control.
#
# Format:  /old-slug  /new-slug  301
#
# (No entries yet.)
#
# The www → apex redirect is NOT here. It's cross-host, which a _redirects file
# can't reliably do on Pages, and www isn't attached to the project — so it
